From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nobody <nobody@localhost>
Date: Fri, 17 Jul 2026 10:08:11 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] ggml-metal: FA-vec per-device (Q,NE) tuning tables (upstream
 #25750)

Ported onto monolithic ggml-metal.metal (pin lacks kernels/ split).
Keeps q8_0 GQA2 path (#25556) as a dedicated kernel alongside Q>1 FA-vec.
